{'symbol': 'KLAC', 'date': '2022-01-27 16:05:00', 'title': 'KLA CORPORATION REPORTS FISCAL 2022 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'MILPITAS, CALIF., JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KLA CORPORATION\xa0(NASDAQ: KLAC) TODAY ANNOUNCED OPERATING RESULTS FOR ITS SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2022, WHICH ENDED ON DEC.\xa031, 2021, AND REPORTED GAAP NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO KLA OF $717.4 MILLION AND GAAP EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE ATTRIBUTABLE TO KLA OF $4.71 ON REVENUE OF $2.35 BILLION.'}